# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# EduPulse AI — .gitignore
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Raw and processed student data ---------------------------------------
# OULAD is CC BY 4.0 and anonymised at source, but student-level records
# should not be pushed to a public repository without confirming that it is
# permitted for your submission. The README explains how to obtain the data.
# Includes anonymisedData.zip (~47 MB): obtain it with src/download_data.py
# instead of committing it. Never commit the ~488 MB unpacked CSV set either.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
data/processed/*
!data/processed/.gitkeep

# Any parquet/feather/arrow exports of student-level tables
*.parquet
*.feather
*.arrow

# --- Secrets ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Never commit API keys (Gemini/OpenAI in Milestone 3) or credentials.
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
secrets.json
config.local.yaml

# --- Python ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.python-version

# --- Testing / tooling -----------------------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
coverage.xml

# --- Notebooks -------------------------------------------------------------
# Strip execution counts/checkpoint noise; the executed notebook itself IS
# committed because it documents the analysis.
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*/.ipynb_checkpoints/*
# Uncomment to avoid committing large embedded outputs:
# *.nbconvert.ipynb

# --- Editors / OS ----------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
~$*
*.log

# --- Generated reports -----------------------------------------------------
# The data-quality report is generated by src/preprocess.py and IS committed
# (it is a deliverable). Figures produced by the notebook are also committed.
reports/figures/*.tmp

# Local RAG reference PDFs
data/rag_sources/

# Temporary backup files
*.bak

# Experimental model not used by the application
models/xgboost_tuned_candidate.joblib